abstract: >-
  Reproducibility archive for the TP-D v0.3 scientific freeze associated with the manuscript
  Kernel Sensitive Z3 x Z3 Two Component Scalar Dark Matter Near the Higgs Resonance. The
  package preserves audit records, numerical outputs, verification code, manuscript source,
  figures, and clean manuscript PDFs for a conditionally viable numerical benchmark within a
  conventional product-discrete scalar effective field theory.
